Name Rio Note - Misc #4 Intercepted Letter

Interactability_Text_Line_0 To my dearest friend,
Interactability_Text_Line_1 In general, life in the slum is okay. Sure, there's the occasional police operation and whatnot, but life tends to be otherwise quiet.
Interactability_Text_Line_2 Well, at least I, personally, think that I may be getting a bit desensitized. We kind of just walled ourselves off with a wall of fire to protect ourselves from the turned.
Interactability_Text_Line_3 The government does nothing for us, so we gotta fend for ourselves... Even if that means swinging guns around as if the place were an active warzone or something.
Interactability_Text_Line_4 Anyway, I feel like we should meet some time, I've got something important to ask you. You already know where. 
Interactability_Text_Line_5 Miss you, 
Interactability_Text_Line_6 Roberto